<i>- ♪ Old hammer ♪
- ♪ Let your hammer ring ♪</i>


01:57:06.750 --> 01:57:09.546
<i>♪ Won't you ring old hammer? ♪</i>


01:57:09.666 --> 01:57:11.113
<i>♪ Let your hammer ring ♪</i>


01:57:11.233 --> 01:57:15.107
- Λοιπόν; Πώς είμαστε;
- Νομίζω το καταλαβαίνει.


01:57:15.875 --> 01:57:18.208
<i>♪ Let your hammer ring... ♪</i>


01:57:22.750 --> 01:57:24.875
<i>♪ Let your hammer ring ♪</i>


